1. c4 e5 { The most principled response } 2. Nc3 (2. g3!? { Against both g3 setups, black can take a c6 approach to prepare d5 } 2... Nc6 3. Nc3 (3. Bg2 Bc5!? 4. Nc3 a6) 3... Bc5!? 4. Bg2 a6 { Transposition to the Serbian System seen below. }) 2... Nc6!? { Serbian System against everything but Nf3 which transposes to the Four Knights. } 3. g3 Bc5! { This move is only possible if white plays g3 and doesn't include Nf3 because of Nxe5 and d4 trick } 4. Bg2 a6! { [%anno "Mikae5", mikae5] We arrive at the crossroads: White usually chooses between Nf3 and e3 Nge2 setups. } { [%cal Gc5a7,Ge2e3,Bg1f3,Bd2d3,Gg1e2] } 5. e3 { [%cal Gg1e2,Gd2d4] } (5. Nf3 d6 6. O-O (6. d3 Ba7 7. a3 h6 { [%csl Bg5][%cal Gg8f6,Yc1g5] }) 6... Nge7! { Der Schlüsselzug. } { [%csl Gf5,Bc6][%cal Gd2d3,Ge2e3] } 7. e3 { [%csl Ge3,Gf3][%cal Gd2d4] } (7. d3 { [%csl Gd3,Gf3] } 7... O-O { [%cal Gf7f5,Gc5a7,Gf5f4,Yh7h6,Yc8e6,Yd8d7] }) 7... Ba7 8. d4 (8. h3!? { [%csl Bg4] } 8... O-O 9. d4 (9. g4? f5) 9... exd4 10. exd4 (10. Nxd4 Nxd4 11. exd4 Nf5 12. d5?? { [%csl Ga7] } 12... Nxg3) 10... Nf5 { [%csl Gd4] } 11. d5?! { [%csl Ga7] } (11. Ne2 Re8 { [%csl Yd4][%cal Gh7h6,Gd8f6,Ge8e2] } 12. b3 Rxe2! 13. Qxe2 Ncxd4 14. Qe4 (14. Nxd4 Bxd4 { [%csl Ra1] } 15. Re1 { [%csl Re8] } (15. Rb1?? Nxg3) 15... Bd7 16. Rb1 Nxg3 $13) 14... Nxg3 15. fxg3 Nxf3+ 16. Kh1 Ne5 $13) 11... Ne5 { [%csl Ga7] } 12. Nxe5 dxe5 13. Ne4 Nd4 { [%cal Gf7f5,Gf5f4] }) 8... exd4 9. exd4 (9. Nxd4 Nxd4 10. exd4 O-O { [%cal Ge7f5] }) 9... Bg4 { [%csl Gf5,Ge7,Gc6,Ga7,Yd4][%cal Ge7f5,Yg4f3] } 10. h3 (10. Be3 Nf5) 10... Bxf3 11. Bxf3 Bxd4 12. Nd5 (12. Bxc6+ Nxc6) 12... Nxd5 13. cxd5 Ne5) 5... d6 6. Nge2 { [%csl Gd4][%cal Gd2d4] } 6... Ba7! 7. O-O (7. d4 exd4 8. exd4 (8. Nxd4 Nxd4 9. exd4 Ne7! { [%cal Ge7f5] } 10. O-O O-O { [%cal Ge7f5] }) 8... Nge7! { [%cal Ge7f5] } 9. O-O O-O 10. b3 Nf5 11. d5 Ne5 12. Bb2 Qf6 13. Ne4 (13. Qd2 Re8 { [%cal Gf6h6] }) 13... Nf3+ 14. Bxf3 Qxb2 15. Nf4 Nd4) (7. Rb1 { [%cal Gb2b4] } 7... Bf5! { [%csl Gb1][%cal Gf5b1,Gf5h3,Gd8d7] } 8. d3 Qd7 { [%csl Gh3] } 9. h3 (9. O-O Bh3 10. b4 h5 { [%cal Gh5h4] }) 9... Nge7! { [%cal Gf5e6,Gf5g6,Ge7f5] }) (7. d3 h5 { [%csl Gh5][%cal Gh5h4] } 8. h3 f5 { [%cal Gg8f6,Gg7g5,Gf5f4] } 9. h4 Nf6 { [%csl Ga7][%cal Gf6g4,Gf5f4] } 10. d4 (10. O-O Ng4 11. b4 g5! { [%csl Gh4][%cal Gh4g3,Bd8h4,Gg5h4] }) 10... O-O 11. b3 f4 12. dxe5 f3 13. Bxf3 Nxe5 14. Bg2 Bg4 15. Bxb7 Nf3+ 16. Kf1 Qd7 { [%cal Gg4h3] } 17. Kg2 Rab8 18. Bd5+ Kh8 19. Bb2 Rbe8 { Giri, Anish - Prusikin, Michael, 1-0, Bundesliga 1213, 2013, https://lichess.org/0bTpOVfo }) 7... h5! 8. h4 (8. h3 h4 9. g4 f5! 10. gxf5 (10. f3 Nge7 11. Kh2 O-O 12. b3 Rb8 { [%cal Gb7b5,Ge7g6] }) 10... Bxf5 11. d4 (11. f4 Qd7 { [%cal Gf5h3] } 12. Kh2 Bd3) 11... Qd7 { [%csl Gh3] } 12. Kh2 g5! { [%cal Gg5g4] } 13. e4 (13. d5 Nd8) 13... Bxh3! 14. Bxh3 g4 15. Bg2?? (15. d5 Nd8 { [%csl Gd8,Gd7][%cal Gd7g7] } 16. Bg2? g3+ { [%csl Ga7] } 17. fxg3 (17. Kh1 Nf6 { [%cal Gh4h3] }) 17... hxg3+ 18. Kxg3 Qg7+ 19. Kf3 Nf6 { [%cal Gg7g4] } 20. Be3 Qg4+ 21. Kf2 Qh4+ 22. Ng3 Ng4+ { [%cal Gh4g3,Gg4e3] }) 15... g3+ { [%csl Gg3,Gh8,Ga7][%cal Ga7g1] } 16. fxg3 hxg3+ 17. Kg1 exd4 $17) (8. d4 h4 { [%cal Gh4g3] } 9. d5? { [%cal Ga7g1] } (9. dxe5? { [%cal Ga7g1] } 9... hxg3 10. hxg3 Nxe5 { [%cal Gd8f6,Gf6h6] } 11. b3 (11. f4 Ng4) (11. Nf4 Qf6 12. Ncd5 Qh6 13. Re1 Bg4) 11... Qf6 { [%cal Gf6h6] } 12. Nf4 Qh6 { [%cal Gc8h3,Gg7g5] }) (9. Bxc6+? bxc6 10. dxe5 hxg3 11. hxg3? (11. fxg3 Bh3 12. Re1 dxe5 13. Qxd8+ Rxd8 14. b3 (14. b4 c5 15. b5 (15. Nd5 Rd7 16. Nec3 c6) 15... Be6) 14... Nf6) 11... Qg5 { [%cal Gc8h3,Gg5h5] } 12. f4 Qh5 { [%cal Gd6e5] }) (9. Nd5 hxg3 10. fxg3 Bg4 { [%csl Yd4] } 11. b4 exd4 12. b5 axb5 13. cxb5 d3 14. Qxd3 Ne5 15. Qc2 c6 16. bxc6 bxc6 17. Nb4 Rc8) (9. b4! { [%cal Gb4b5] } 9... hxg3 10. hxg3? (10. fxg3 Nf6 { [%cal Gc8g4] }) 10... Qg5 { [%cal Gg5h5,Gg5h6] } 11. Nd5 (11. f4 Qh5 { [%cal Gh5h2,Gg1f2,Gc8h3] } 12. Kf2 Nf6 13. Rh1 Ng4+ 14. Kg1 (14. Kf3 Nh2+ 15. Kf2 exd4 16. exd4 Bf5 { [%csl Rf2][%cal Ge8g8,Ge8c8] }) 14... Qxh1+ 15. Bxh1 Rxh1+ 16. Kxh1 Nf2+) 11... Qh6 12. f3 Bh3 { [%cal Yh3g2] } 13. Bxh3 Qxh3 14. Kf2 O-O-O 15. b5 axb5 16. cxb5 Nge7! 17. bxc6 Nxd5 18. cxb7+ Kb8 { [%csl Gb8,Rf2] } 19. Qb3 Qe6 { [%csl Yd4][%cal Gh8h2] }) 9... Nce7 10. e4 hxg3 11. hxg3 Nf6 12. Be3 (12. Qd3 Ng4 13. Be3 Nxe3 14. fxe3 Ng6 15. Rf3 Bg4) 12... Bxe3 13. fxe3 Ng4 14. Qd2 Ng6 15. Nc1 Qg5 16. Rf3 Nh2) (8. Nd5 h4 9. b4 { [%cal Gb4b5] } 9... Nce7 10. d4 hxg3 11. hxg3 Nxd5 12. cxd5 Qg5 $17 { [%cal Gg5h5] }) 8... g5! { [%cal Gg5h4,Gh4g3,Gh5h4] } 9. hxg5 (9. d4 gxh4 { [%cal Gh4g3] } 10. gxh4 (10. d5 Nce7 11. b4 hxg3 12. fxg3 h4) 10... Qxh4 11. d5 Nf6! { [%cal Gf6g4] } 12. dxc6 Ng4) 9... h4!? (9... Qxg5 10. Nd5 Kf8 11. Nxc7?! h4 12. Nxa8 Nf6 { [%cal Gf6g4,Gg5h5] }) 10. d4 Qxg5 11. Nd5 (11. e4? Qh5 12. Be3 (12. Nd5 Bg4 13. Nxc7+ Kf8 14. Nxa8 h3) 12... h3 13. Bh1 (13. Nf4 Qxd1 14. Rfxd1 exf4 15. gxf4 hxg2) 13... h2+ 14. Kg2 Qh3+ 15. Kf3 Bg4#) (11. dxe5 Bg4 12. exd6 O-O-O 13. Qa4 (13. Bxc6 bxc6 14. Qa4 hxg3 15. Qxa6+ Kd7 16. Qxa7 Rh1+ 17. Kg2 Bh3+ 18. Kxh1 g2+ 19. Kg1 gxf1=Q+ 20. Kh2 Qgg2#) 13... hxg3 14. fxg3 Bxe2 15. Nxe2 Rxd6) 11... Kf8! 12. Nxc7 Rb8 (12... hxg3!? 13. Nxa8? (13. Nxg3? Bg4 (13... Qh4 14. Re1 Qh2+ 15. Kf1 Rh6 16. Nxa8 Rf6 { [%cal Gc8h3] } 17. a3) 14. f3 Bh3 { [%csl Gg3][%cal Gg5g3] } 15. Qe1 Qh6 16. Nxa8 (16. Rf2 Rc8) 16... Bxg2 { [%cal Gh6h2] } 17. Kf2 Qh2) 13... Qh4) 13. f4 Qh6 $17 *


